  "title": "Classic, Hearty Beef Stew",
  "description": "This hearty beef stew is loaded with juicy chunks of beef, tender vegetables, savory spices, and fragrant herbs for the perfect cold weather meal.",
  "authors": [
    "Matthew Francis"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-10-19T20:03:00-04:00",
